  "_comment": "SCROLL-STABILITY probe. 12 turns, a shot after EVERY turn with no summon and no dismiss_message, so the ONLY thing touching the map is the turn cycle itself. Measures whether releasing the spoofed input focus after each input stops CTP2 edge-scrolling against the operator real cursor."
 },
