 {
  "_comment": "(600,6) is empty chrome in the top menu bar, between the Options menu and the gold readout -- nothing is hit-tested there, so this delivers a mouse message without activating a control. This is the ONLY posted click in the file; every UI action below is injection or a key."
 },
